// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 9. failure-mode-taxonomy.svg  (i10 fallback on the taxonomy page) — no
//    numeric values; classifications per RB-007 Table 3.9 (rb-007:463-469):
//    FM-1 design-locked, FM-2 and FM-5 partially correctable, FM-3/4/6 fully
